Retailer data — not licensed, collected and displayed as facts
--------------------------------------------------------------

Prices, discount percentages, product names and validity dates are collected
from the public offer pages of Migros, Denner, Lidl and Aligro. They are
statements of fact about what those shops charge this week, gathered for
comparison and reproduced with attribution and a link to the original page.

Product images are hot-linked from each retailer's own CDN. They are not copied
into or redistributed by this repository, and their copyright stays with
whoever holds it.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by or connected to
any of those retailers. Their names and logos are their own trade marks, used
here only to say which shop an offer came from.
